# PengyOS (every edition). Presets are read in name order, first match wins.
# A unit no preset file names is ENABLED by Buildroot's `systemctl preset-all`
# (systemd's default for an unmatched unit), so every package that ships a
# daemon with an [Install] section needs a deliberate line somewhere.
#
# xfsprogs is in the image to mount XFS disks from other systems; no PengyOS
# partition is XFS. Its weekly xfs_scrub_all.timer found nothing to do on every
# machine, or scrubbed whatever disk happened to be plugged in.
disable xfs_scrub_all.timer
